# Quantum Niche Optimizer

> A niche-optimizer project with a quantum-themed name. This wrap points back to the source.

## Purpose
Give a plain-language door to fitzyracing1/quantum-niche-optimizer.

## How it works (plain English)
1. Keep the original repo as the place for the optimizer.
2. Use this clone to explain the idea.
3. Send the reader back to the source to run it.

